Aaldenburg has not stopped tinkering since you last saw her. Does she ever take a break?
It does not look like you’re going to be able to get a word in at this moment.
-> Leave her to her tinkering.
    She shows no sign of noticing your departure. Or in fact, of having noticed your presence in the first place. 
    Maybe she will be less busy later…
    << if $TechMajor == true >> 
        You know she won’t be, though. A scientist’s hands are never idle.
